-
-Invoke the `tusker` skill when work affects planning, tracked implementation, PR evidence, demos, docs, review, or closeout.
-
-- The task note is the unit of work.
-- Use `tusker search` and exact task paths before broad repository search.
-- Use `tusker show <ID> --capsule` before reading a full old task.
-- Keep lookup/bookkeeping light; do not run closeout ceremony unless moving implementation work to review/done/human-wait.
